00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:05.880
But obviously,
underneath all of this,

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:09.450
what is powering all of this,
what makes all of this possible

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:11.640
is the INTIENT data fabric--

