research scientists.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:37.140
And how, ultimately, we action--

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:40.050
how do we actually
inform partner companies,

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:42.930
other scientists,
colleagues across the globe

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:46.740
to do something as a consequence
