00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:50.240
integrated request
management capability?

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:53.370
So you can see at all levels
here in drug discovery,

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:55.660
in pharmaceutical
research, how INTIENT

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:58.590
and how the platform
that Kevin described

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:02.190
addresses the key bottlenecks--
the bringing together the data,

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:05.340
aggregating the data,
and presenting it

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:09.250
