predictable fashion.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.560
Success in research
then takes us forward

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.490
into pharmaceutical development.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:17.620
So let's take a similar
view of clinical trials.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.770
And we start in a
very similar way.

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:24.360
We start with the complexity
of managing very large, very

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:28.890
