complex interactive analyses.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.960
So again, we see how the
INTIENT solution, the platform

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:49.460
capabilities addressing these
complexities and challenges

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.550
