that makes the data usable

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:03.870
and actionable, actions
to actually remediate

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:08.730
issues in a much more timely
fashion, and visualizations

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:11.940
through interactive
dashboards, predictive tools,

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:16.600
predictive simulation,
and analytics methods.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:19.650
So again, if we go to
look at a screenshot here,

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.110
